---
import LegalLayout from '@layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import Tbd from '@components/ui/Tbd.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import { pathFor } from '@i18n/utils';

const title = 'Privacy policy';
const description =
  'How Valvio Contexpert Business SRL collects and processes personal data, under the GDPR and Romanian Law 190/2018.';
---

<LegalLayout title={title} description={description} updated="2026-08-30">
  <p class="lede">
    This policy explains what personal data we collect through this site, why,
    and what rights you have. We process data under Regulation (EU) 2016/679
    (GDPR) and Romanian Law 190/2018.
  </p>

  <h2>Data controller</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>Name</dt>
    <dd>{site.legalName}</dd>
    <dt>Registered office</dt>
    <dd>{site.address.street}, {site.address.city}, {site.address.region}</dd>
    <dt>CUI (tax ID)</dt>
    <dd>{site.registration.cui ? site.registration.cui : <Tbd label="CUI / CIF" />}</dd>
    <dt>Trade Register no.</dt>
    <dd>{site.registration.tradeRegister ? site.registration.tradeRegister : <Tbd label="Trade Register number" />}</dd>
    <dt>Email</dt>
    <dd><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></dd>
    <dt>Phone</dt>
    <dd><a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></dd>
  </dl>
  <p>
    For any request about your personal data, email us at
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
  <p>
    We only collect what you send through the contact form, so we can reply and
    prepare a quote:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>full name;</li>
    <li>email address;</li>
    <li>phone number (optional);</li>
    <li>company name (optional);</li>
    <li>the content of your message.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use this data for marketing and we do not sell it to anyone.</p>

  <h2>Legal basis</h2>
  <p>
    Processing rests on Article 6 GDPR: steps taken at your request before a
    contract (Art. 6(1)(b)) and our legitimate interest in answering enquiries
    (Art. 6(1)(f)). On the same legitimate-interest basis, the map on the contact
    page loads automatically to give you directions to the office.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep messages received through the form for <Tbd label="message retention period" />,
    then delete them, unless you become a client, in which case statutory
    accounting retention periods apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>our website hosting provider: <Tbd label="hosting provider" />;</li>
    <li>
      Google, through the map loaded on the contact page — see the
      <a href={pathFor('cookies', 'en')}>cookie policy</a>;
    </li>
    <li>public authorities, only where the law requires it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Transfers outside the EU / EEA</h2>
  <p>
    We do not transfer data outside the European Economic Area, except through the
    Google map on the contact page, in which case Google's standard contractual
    clauses may apply. Details: <Tbd label="transfer mechanism used by the map provider" />.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the GDPR you have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access your data and receive a copy;</li>
    <li>rectify inaccurate data;</li>
    <li>erasure (the right to be forgotten);</li>
    <li>restrict processing;</li>
    <li>object to processing;</li>
    <li>data portability;</li>
    <li>withdraw consent at any time.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise these rights, email us at
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. You also have the right to
    lodge a complaint with the Romanian National Supervisory Authority for
    Personal Data Processing (ANSPDCP),
    <a href="https://www.dataprotection.ro" rel="noopener">dataprotection.ro</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over HTTPS only, and fonts are self-hosted, so no
    third-party requests are made when a page loads. We apply reasonable
    technical and organisational measures to protect the data we receive.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy. The version in force is the one published on this
    page, with the last-updated date shown above.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
